n hair pinned away from the temples. On an ordinary day, the familiar outfit is a black overshirt with pearl buttons with a folded shopping list secured by a miniature clip. In conversation Diana rubs a thumb along the edge of the nearest pocket.","personality":"Diana admires skill and distrusts the idea that skill gives anyone permission to be rude. Diana learns fastest from somebody willing to show how they made a mistake.","agenda":"To include the successor's verse in the docking song.","family":"Jules Brady is Diana’s cousin raised in the same household. Diana leaves the first voice message. Jules calls back when there is finally a little privacy. In their family a missed ring can mean a bus, a customer, a sleeping child or a bad hour. Neither treats it as an answer in itself. Asked about *A closing hour*, Jules says, “I left my grandfather's coat inside Friday night.”","connections":"Oakley Carbone. A docking tune gives a child a first pier lesson they can remember at home.","familyIds":["AH-R1358"],"connectionIds":["AH-R1197"],"reactions":[{"situation":"An owner offers the former skipper a title with no clear duties","response":"Diana asks what actual work, hours and wage go with the shore title.","asWritten":"An owner offers the former skipper a title with no clear duties. Diana asks what actual work, hours and wage go with the shore title."},{"situation":"A cyclist goes down in a crowded crossing","response":"Diana tells the first helper what they actually saw and makes room for the rider to answer for themself.","asWritten":"A cyclist goes down in a crowded crossing. Diana tells the first helper what they actually saw and makes room for the rider to answer for themself."},{"situation":"When a beginner is embarrassed","response":"Diana describes a first attempt of their own in enough detail to make the comparison fair.","asWritten":"When a beginner is embarrassed, Diana describes a first attempt of their own in enough detail to make the comparison fair."}]},